## Usage

Each page object provides methods for interacting with Salesforce UI elements. Import and use them in your Playwright tests:

```typescript
import { {{#each pageObjects}}{{this.name}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}} } from './pages/...';

test('example test', async ({ page }) => {
  const pageObject = new {{pageObjects.0.name}}(page);
  await pageObject.goto();
  // Use page object methods...
});
```

